>>
Rule 1 (input must be a Tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (out tensor, if provided, must have the same number of dimensions as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
>>
Rule 3 (out tensor, if provided, must have the same shape as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 4 (out tensor, if provided, must have a dtype compatible with the result: match input dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1)
